* PexObserve provides several methods to record and display values in the PexRun viewer for a better traceability of the test execution
* PexObserve methods are used to record the execution of tests in PexRun viewer, so can re-run the tests and can trace the behavior of different branches
* AllElementsStayTheSame is user-defined function checking the condition for arraylist to be same before and after operation

